============================================================================================

  EXACT EXHAUSTIVE REGIME-A CERTIFICATE (span <= B(k)), k=8,9,10:

   k=8: B(k)=16, 11432 primitive shapes -- ALL meas(S7)<=cap AND ALL L_y<=cap.
